      "object_id": "mathia_synthesis_48010c06c9ba15b11a2620230d9d8a0b51768a152998c5347242e7cea03baaa0",
      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The proposal juxtaposes two uses of probabilistic language around zeta: an exact scalar coefficient involving zeta(1/2) in a Gaussian ladder-height expansion and a numerical freezing diagnostic for a field of critical-line values. The cited parents establish no transform, shared observable, or implication connecting those constructions.",
